Project assets and generated material
-------------------------------------
tools/license_manifest.json is the machine-readable provenance record for this
distribution. It partitions every tracked file into a license family, pins the
upstream commits the derived files came from, and maps how each legal text
travels through the install prefix and the tutorial archives. Non-text assets
are inventoried there rather than spelled out here.

The icon atlas (icons/), the usdview icons
(plugin/rigExecUsdview/icons/), the asset_lib component library, the example
artwork, the documentation assets and the test fixtures are recorded there as
families carrying no license grant yet. Their terms await owner confirmation;
until an answer is recorded, the project MIT license does not cover them.
